{"id":"n84592-1-11","stage":5,"title":"하천 · 河川","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n84592-1-11-1","ko":"이 마을은 공기가 좋네요.","zh":"这个村庄的空气真好啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"마을은","meaning":"村子，村庄","explanation":"마을：村子，村庄；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"마을","audio":"/audio/16a6e53889b32d5b72f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61099","senseId":"1","lemma":"마을","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마을은","audio":"/audio/6918fc2452047ca5849c.mp3"}},{"text":"공기가","meaning":"空气","explanation":"공기：空气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"공기","audio":"/audio/a2408f7470488114eeae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22637","senseId":"1","lemma":"공기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공기가","audio":"/audio/8e0473329edee8448dd7.mp3"}},{"text":"좋네요.","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋네요","audio":"/audio/e36ecc80346ba52c878b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"16a6e53889b32d5b","term":"마을","zh":"村子，村庄","audio":"/audio/16a6e53889b32d5b72f4.mp3","entryId":"61099","definition":"多户人家聚集生活的地方。","pronunciation":["마을"]},{"id":"a2408f7470488114","term":"공기","zh":"空气","audio":"/audio/a2408f7470488114eeae.mp3","entryId":"22637","definition":"分层覆盖在地球或星球表面的气体。","pronunciation":["공기"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term"