。","readings":[{"term":"경관","audio":"/audio/8c84d98827f83b8285cc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32344","senseId":"1","lemma":"경관","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"경관도","audio":"/audio/644a0d67f12eb80d9867.mp3"}},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确。","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아요.","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아요","audio":"/audio/4e89f12afd275d8a286b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，是的，哎","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于回应长辈的呼叫。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"619f5372a1e42afc","term":"게다가","zh":"加上，外加","audio":"/audio/619f5372a1e42afcadef.mp3","entryId":"62261","definition":"除此以外。","pronunciation":["게다가"]},{"id":"47722f59a7d13924","term":"하천","zh":"河川，河流","audio":"/audio/47722f59a7d1392452b7.mp3","entryId":"84592","definition":"江和小溪。","pronunciation":["하천"]},{"id":"91dc8d3e5e85cc29","term":"흐르다","zh":"流，流淌","audio":"/audio/91dc8d3e5e85cc29b8fa.mp3","entryId":"29757","definition":"水等液体向低处流动或经过某一地点。","pronunciation":["흐르다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"8c84d98827f83b82","term":"경관","zh":"景观，景色","audio":"/audio/8c84d98827f83b8285cc.mp3","entryId":"32344","definition":"山野江海等大自然或周围整体的样子。","pronunciation":["경관"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背